---
/**
 * TypeIcon.astro — the small icon inside every .type-badge (EntryMeta.astro
 * and the participant page's own badge). One shared icon, not one per
 * entry type: the badge text already names the type, and every badge's
 * click action is the same shape (narrow the archive down to just this
 * type) -- a search icon matches what clicking does, not what the type
 * is. Feather Icons' "search" path (24x24, stroke-based), matching the
 * header's existing icons -- the site's only established icon language.
 */
---
<svg class="type-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="12" height="12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
  <circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/>
  <line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"/>
</svg>
